From: Gerwout van der Veen <gerwoutvdveen@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] DSi: StopDMAs passes the NDMA start mode

StopDMAs gave StopNDMAs the DS start mode. The VBlank's StopDMAs(0, 4) (main memory display FIFO) disabled
ARM9 NDMAs in NDMA mode 4, the DS cart slot. The mode is translated as in CheckDMAs.
---
--- a/src/DSi.cpp
+++ b/src/DSi.cpp
@@ -1131,7 +1131,7 @@
 void DSi::StopDMAs(u32 cpu, u32 mode)
 {
     NDS::StopDMAs(cpu, mode);
-    StopNDMAs(cpu, mode);
+    StopNDMAs(cpu, NDMAModes[mode]);
 }
 
 void DSi::CheckDMAs(u32 cpu, u32 mode)
